If a clinician does not provably detect a life-threatening-warning then it is possible that a rapid-opioid-taper-benefit does not likely outweigh a rapid-opioid-taper-risk.
If a clinician does not provably detect a life-threatening-warning then it is possible that an abrupt-opioid-discontinuation-benefit does not likely outweigh an abrupt-opioid-discontinuation-risk.
